# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
@keyframes fade {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    display: block;
  }
  50%, 75% {
    color: red;
    /* Keep this comment with display. */
    display: block;
  }
  to {
    color: red;
    display: block;
  }
}

@-webkit-keyframes fade {
  to {
    transform: translateX(10px);
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  @keyframes slide {
    to {
      transform: translateX(10px);
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
}

@keyframes unsafe {
  from {
    margin-top: 1px;
    margin: 0;
  }
}

@keyframes unchanged {
  from {
    display: block;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  50% {
    color: red;
    unknown-property: 0;
    display: block;
  }
  to {
    color: red;
    color: blue;
  }
}

@font-face {
  font-style: normal;
  font-family: example;
}

@keyframes no-semicolon {
  to {
    color: red;
    display: block
  }
}

@keyframes duplicates {
  to {
    color: red;
    color: blue;
    ;
    display: block;
    --alpha: 1;
  }
}

```

